								<p>These tasks gave me practice across development, design, website management, and client support. I learned to switch between tools based on project needs while keeping the work organized and focused on the requested outcome.</p>

								<h3 class="h3-sub">Building Real Projects While Improving My Laravel and Design Skills</h3>
								<p>MCTech also gave me more experience with coding, especially Laravel. I worked on freelance projects, built website features, fixed issues, and created mockups for company clients. Working with existing code helped me understand how real projects are structured and maintained. I also learned how design decisions affect development, from planning layouts in mockups to turning those ideas into working pages.</p>
								<p>My time at MCTech helped me grow through real projects, client work, and daily development tasks. Each experience gave me new skills I’ll bring into future freelance and development projects.</p>
