								<h3 class="main-headline-jry">From Our Capstone Idea to a Working Local Service Booking Platform</h3>
								<p>Servease was created as our capstone project by a team of five members. We wanted to build a local service booking platform where customers could find services and connect with providers. As the team leader, I handled much of the coding, helped plan the development stages, reviewed our progress, and guided the team as we worked through each part of the system.</p>
								<p>We started with our capstone idea and planned the features based on the needs of our users. We created the UI/UX mockups in Figma before starting development. Our team reviewed the designs during QA, discussed what needed to change, and improved the user flow. We then moved from static frontend development to Laravel, database logic, CMS features, authentication, testing, and deployment.</p>
