								<p>We added a cron job to help manage unfinished bookings. The system checks booking records and looks for completed bookings left without a proper status update. After 16 hours, the system automatically closes the booking. This keeps the booking records updated without requiring manual action.</p>
								<p>As the team leader, I helped organize the development process and guided our five-member team. I handled much of the coding, reviewed features, helped solve technical issues, and joined the team during UI/UX reviews and QA. I also helped make sure our final system followed our planned capstone requirements.</p>
								<h3 class="h3-sub">Capstone Defense:</h3>
								<p>After completing the system, our team successfully defended the Servease capstone project. We presented our system, explained our development process, demonstrated its features, and answered questions about the decisions behind our project.</p>
								<p>Building Servease gave me experience in leading a team while developing a complete system. It helped me improve my coding, UI/UX, testing, deployment, and problem-solving skills through a real capstone project.</p>
